Best viewed in HD 
Finally, my first video shot with much hyped Canon 5D Mark II. This candid video was shot at Arambol beach, Goa. I shot it for 2 evenings between 5-6pm. I was taking a break in Goa and to see what I can shoot with 5D. This is what I got. All the people seen in this video were being themselves and enjoying their time. I was mesmerized seeing their performances and I couldn't resist capturing their joy! 
5D? Yup, it lived up-to expectations! I had a tough time carrying the bulky cam with 70-200 f2.8 and focusing it manually. 
It's all spontaneous hand-held cinematography, no planned choreography and NO post-processing at all.  
Special thanks to my friends Rohit Kamarthi for showing me the location...  Balu Reddy for carrying my camera bag while I was running around to capture the performances. :)
I have a new reason to visit Goa next time! :)